  "blocks": {
    "/skills-catalog": {
      "These are the agent skills I lean on every day. They live in my ~/.claude directory and ship as a public repo so anyone can install them, fork them, or open a PR with their own.": "这些是我每天依赖的智能体技能。它们位于我的 <code>~/.claude</code> 目录，并以公开仓库形式发布，任何人都可以安装、派生，或提交包含自己技能的 PR。",
      "A skill is a focused, repeatable workflow an agent can run. It bundles a clear instruction set, the inputs it needs, and the outputs you should expect. Skills live as small markdown files that any Claude-compatible agent picks up.": "技能是智能体可以运行的一种聚焦、可重复工作流。它把清晰的指令集、所需输入和预期输出打包在一起。技能以小型 Markdown 文件存在，任何兼容 Claude 的智能体都能读取。",
      "The point isn't to wrap the agent in scaffolding. It's to write down the exact moves I'd make for a given problem so the agent runs them the same way I would, every time.": "重点不是给智能体套上一层脚手架，而是把我面对某类问题时会采取的确切步骤写下来，让智能体每次都能像我一样执行。",
      "One command pulls the whole catalog into your global skills directory:": "一条命令即可把整套目录安装到全局技能目录：",
      "Drop -g to install into the current project only. Once installed, any agent that reads ~/.claude/skills (Claude Code is the obvious one) can pick a skill from the catalog and run it.": "去掉 <code>-g</code> 即可只安装到当前项目。安装后，任何读取 <code>~/.claude/skills</code> 的智能体（最典型的是 Claude Code）都能从目录中选择并运行技能。",
      "You can also install individual skills if you don't want the whole set. Browse the source for slugs: github.com/mattpocock/skills.": "如果不需要整套技能，也可以单独安装某个技能。可以在源仓库中查看各个 slug：<code>github.com/mattpocock/skills</code>。",
      "Each skill below is a workflow I reach for in a specific moment: a vague spec to interrogate, a domain to model, a PRD to write, a backlog to break down, a feature to test-drive. They aren't \"AI productivity hacks.\" They're how I keep my taste and standards intact while the agent does the work.": "下面每项技能都是我在特定时刻会使用的一种工作流：追问模糊的规格说明、建立领域模型、编写 PRD、拆分待办，以及用测试驱动功能开发。它们不是“AI 效率秘诀”，而是我在让智能体执行工作的同时，保持个人判断和工程标准的方法。",
      "The catalog lives at github.com/mattpocock/skills. If you've shaped a skill that's earned its place in your workflow, share it.": "技能目录位于 <code>github.com/mattpocock/skills</code>。如果你打磨出了一项值得纳入工作流的技能，欢迎分享出来。"
    }
  }
